000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. KSDSBOTH.
000300*One program opens the KSDS OUTPUT, then INPUT, then I-O. The
000400*ACB's assembled MACRF once carried OUT,RST into every OPEN, so
000500*the OPEN INPUT emptied the cluster the OPEN OUTPUT had just
000600*loaded; and a REWRITE or DELETE with ACCESS DYNAMIC acted on the
000700*record the last READ held instead of the one the key names
000800*(#37). By the standard's text: IBM ANS COBOL has no VSAM.
000900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001100 FILE-CONTROL.
001200     SELECT K-FILE ASSIGN TO KSDSF01
001300         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001400         ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
001500         RECORD KEY IS K-KEY
001600         FILE STATUS IS K-STATUS.
001700 DATA DIVISION.
001800 FILE SECTION.
001900 FD  K-FILE LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002000     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002100 01  K-REC.
002200     05  K-KEY   PIC X(10).
002300     05  K-TEXT  PIC X(5).
002400     05  FILLER  PIC X(65).
002500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002600 01  K-STATUS PIC XX VALUE '00'.
002700 01  EOF      PIC X  VALUE 'N'.
002800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002900 MAIN-PARA.
003000     OPEN OUTPUT K-FILE.
003100     DISPLAY 'OPEN OUTPUT ' K-STATUS.
003200     MOVE SPACES TO K-REC.
003300     MOVE '0000000001' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'ONE' TO K-TEXT.
003400     WRITE K-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'WRITE 1 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
003500     MOVE '0000000002' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'TWO' TO K-TEXT.
003600     WRITE K-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'WRITE 2 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
003700     MOVE '0000000003' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'THREE' TO K-TEXT.
003800     WRITE K-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'WRITE 3 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
003900     MOVE '0000000004' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'FOUR' TO K-TEXT.
004000     WRITE K-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'WRITE 4 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
004100     CLOSE K-FILE.
004200     PERFORM READ-ALL.
004300     OPEN I-O K-FILE.
004400     DISPLAY 'OPEN I-O ' K-STATUS.
004500     MOVE SPACES TO K-REC.
004600     MOVE '0000000002' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'DEUX' TO K-TEXT.
004700     REWRITE K-REC
004800         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'REWRITE 2 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
004900     DISPLAY 'REWRITE 2 ' K-STATUS.
005000     MOVE '0000000003' TO K-KEY.
005100     DELETE K-FILE
005200         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'DELETE 3 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
005300     DISPLAY 'DELETE 3 ' K-STATUS.
005400     MOVE '0000000009' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'NINE' TO K-TEXT.
005500     REWRITE K-REC
005600         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'REWRITE 9 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
005700     MOVE '0000000009' TO K-KEY.
005800     DELETE K-FILE
005900         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'DELETE 9 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
006000     CLOSE K-FILE.
006100     PERFORM READ-ALL.
006200     STOP RUN.
006300 READ-ALL.
006400     OPEN INPUT K-FILE.
006500     DISPLAY 'OPEN INPUT ' K-STATUS.
006600     MOVE 'N' TO EOF.
006700     READ K-FILE NEXT RECORD AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF.
006800     PERFORM SHOW UNTIL EOF = 'Y'.
006900     CLOSE K-FILE.
007000 SHOW.
007100     DISPLAY 'READ ' K-KEY ' ' K-TEXT.
007200     READ K-FILE NEXT RECORD AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF.
